{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-13T17:36:44.379Z","data":{"text":"Both verifies pass.\n\n**Summary**\n\nImplemented task 2 of change `186-task-outcomes-and-plan-hints`:\n\n- **`config-planning.ts`** — added `PlanningHistoryConfig`, `DEFAULT_PLANNING_HISTORY` (30/100/1500), `history` on `DEFAULT_PLANNING_CONFIG` and as an optional field on `PlanningConfig`, and made `validatePlanningConfig` always resolve it. Generalized the positive-integer check (previously `validateDisclosureCount`) so both `planning.disclosures.*` and `planning.history.*` share it, keeping the existing disclosure messages.\n- **`src/core/report/history-hints.ts`** (new) — `formatHistoryHints(rows, limits)` producing the counted section body or `null`, plus `readHistoryHintRows` (builds `buildHistoryTables`, selects `task_outcomes` rows with attempts ≥ 1, closes the DB in `finally`) and `formatPlanHintSections`, which returns both optional sections.\n- **`src/cli/plan.ts`** — `buildOpeningPrompt` now places `## What history says` after the repository record and before `## Recent executor disclosures`, each omitted when absent; stayed within the 250-line budget (249).\n- **Tests** — added `tests/plan-history.test.ts` proving all five scenarios, and updated only the expected planning objects in `tests/config-planning.test.ts`.\n\nTask verify (`node --import tsx --import ./tests/git-test-env.ts --test tests/plan-history.test.ts`) and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`) both exit 0. Result written to `.run/results/2.md`."}}
